  - BIO-REGENERATION is three uses per day of 1D6x10 M.D.C., a trackable resource.
  - BONUSES: +3 save vs magic (spell_magic), +3 vs psionics, +5 vs horror factor;
    +1 parry, +2 dodge, +3 initiative from supersensitive hearing, stored
    unconditionally since the hearing is always on; +1 attack from strength and
    agility. No base number of attacks is printed; it comes from Hand to Hand.
  - HORROR FACTOR 12 is the one the giant imposes, stored in horror_factor.
  - SKILLS: Skin & Prepare Animal Hides prints +20% large / +10% small; stored at
    the large-animal figure with the small one in the note. Track Animals maps to
    Track & Trap Animals. Hand to Hand: Martial Arts is granted outright and the
    book prints no upgrade price, so there is no hand_to_hand block. No languages
    are printed as R.C.C. skills and none is invented.
  - R.C.C. RELATED SKILLS: the book gives this R.C.C. its own related list (six,
    plus two at 3/6/9/12/15), so it is stored as occ_related_skills; no
    secondary skills are printed. The Cibola/native split on Pilot, Pilot Related,
    Rogue and the two W.P.s is stored at the wider Cibola reading, with the
    native limit in the notes and restrictions. Horsemanship is granted as a
    category because the Pilot line names it. Science "math and astronomy"
    grants both Mathematics rows and both Astronomy rows. Technical "languages,
    literacy and lore" is an only list of every Language, Literacy and Lore row
    the Technical category held on 2026-09-25, plus Literacy: Other (a
    Communications row, reachable because Communications is granted); a
    language or lore added to the catalog later will not appear until the list
    is extended. Communications is Radio: Basic and Radio: Scramblers.
  - EQUIPMENT: heavy energy rifle is a choice from catalog rows; dragon-skin
    armor (250 to 300 M.D.C.) is the dragon-skin-armor row add-south-america-rcc-gear.sql adds; two archaic
    weapons are chosen from catalog rows (the book says two or three). The book
